# Inputs at a sixth of the width from the axis excite no mode of order 2, 5, 8: two images appear at L_pi / 2 = 46.35 um.
# Reference: a 3 dB split near that length.
title 2x2 multimode interferometer at 1 of the 3 dB length
reference 2.8
grid dx=0.02 dz=0.25
window width=16 length=71.25
guide straight x=-1 width=1.2 from=0 to=10
guide straight x=0 width=6 from=10 to=56.25
guide straight x=1 width=1.2 from=56.25 to=71.25
guide straight x=-1 width=1.2 from=56.25 to=71.25
launch mode x=-1 width=1.2
monitor bar z=71.25 x=-1 width=1.2
monitor cross z=71.25 x=1 width=1.2
plane end z=71.25
expect power bar 0.491349109 2e-7
expect power cross 0.487436907 2e-7
expect total end 0.999376634 2e-7
expect centroid end 0.0026461 2e-6
expect radius end 2.2348449 2e-6
expect neff 2.824894866 2e-8
expect sum bar cross 0.9 0.1
expect ratio bar cross 1.0 0.15
